### 1. Tüm Görevleri Getir
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks

### 2. ID'si 1 Olan Görevi Getir
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1

### 3. Yeni Görev Ekle
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dokümantasyon Hazırla",
  "projectId": "p1",
  "assignedTo": "Mehmet",
  "priority": "low"
}

### 4. Görevin Durumunu Güncelle (Statüyü done yap)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### 5. Görevi Sil
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1